third-party.json is the pinned Ghostty VT dependency inventory, including its
linked dependencies and build-only aro entry. Their upstream license and
attribution texts are preserved in the corresponding component directories:
highway, simdutf, translate_c, uucode, wuffs, and aro. The uucode supplemental
notices are included from the same pinned upstream revision because its Zig
package omits the licenses directory referenced by LICENSE.md.

The zig directory retains Zig 0.17.1 and LLVM runtime notices for native builds.
The compiler distribution itself is not included in this application package.

manifest.json records the source revision/origin and SHA-256 of each notice.
All original license files are copied without text edits. This notice is
additional attribution; it does not replace those license terms or relicense
the upstream components.
